      <h1>Synthetic business-system review and withholding overview</h1>
      <div class="meta-row">
  <span>As of <time datetime="2026-02-01">2026-02-01</time></span>
  <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
  <span>Review by <time datetime="2026-07-31">2026-07-31</time></span>
  <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
  <span><b>1 of 2</b> claims supported</span>
  <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
  
  <span>Last verified <time datetime="2026-02-10">2026-02-10</time></span>
  
  <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
  <span>Readiness <b>SYNTHETIC-NOW</b></span>
  <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
  <span class="mono">cmp-system-review</span>
</div>
      <div class="page-actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn sm" id="fb:copyLinkBtn" data-copy-link="cmp-system-review">Copy link</button>
        <div class="seg" id="fb:wordingSeg" role="group" aria-label="Wording">
          <button type="button" data-wording="both" aria-pressed="true">Both</button>
          <button type="button" data-wording="plain" aria-pressed="false">Plain</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    
    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="purpose">
      <h2 id="purpose">Purpose</h2>
      
      <p>Explain how a synthetic <span class="term" data-pv="term:system_review" data-pv-title="system review" data-pv-body="Synthetic periodic assessment of business-system control operation.">system review</span> interacts with a synthetic <span class="term" data-pv="term:billing_withhold" data-pv-title="billing withhold" data-pv-body="Synthetic retention of a percentage of interim payments pending system correction.">billing withhold</span>.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="the-rule">
      <h2 id="the-rule">The rule</h2>
      
      <p>A synthetic system review runs on a recurring cycle of 30 days <a class="cite-n" href="#cite-1" data-pv="cite:1" data-pv-title="CL-CMP-0001" data-pv-body="Synthetic compliance reviews occur every 30 days under the synthetic rule." aria-label="Source 1">1</a>. When a synthetic deficiency remains open, the synthetic billing withhold rate is 5 percent <a class="cite-n" href="#cite-2" data-pv="cite:2" data-pv-title="CL-CMP-0002" data-pv-body="Synthetic withholding threshold is 5 percent of billed amounts." aria-label="Source 2">2</a>.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="how-it-works">
      <h2 id="how-it-works">How it works</h2>
      
      <p>Synthetic reviewers check control operation and record open items before billing runs.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="worked-example">
      <h2 id="worked-example">Worked example</h2>
      
      <p>Synthetic example. The numbers are made up.</p>
<p>On a synthetic invoice of 100,000 USD, a 5 percent withhold retains 5,000 USD until the review closes.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="never-confuse">
      <h2 id="never-confuse">Never confuse</h2>
      
      <p>Do not confuse a synthetic system review or a synthetic billing withhold with a final contract closeout audit.</p>

      
      
<div class="conflict-box" id="conflict-XC-01">
  <div class="conflict-head">
    <span class="chip warn"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2.5 14 13H2L8 2.5Z"/><path d="M8 6.5v3"/><circle cx="8" cy="11.2" r="0.6"/></svg><span>Unresolved</span></span>
    <span class="cite neutral" data-pv="xc:XC-01" data-pv-title="XC-01" data-pv-body="Synthetic review interval versus withholding check timing">XC-01</span>
    <b class="conflict-topic">Synthetic review interval versus withholding check timing</b>
    
    <span class="conflict-q">Settled by <span class="cite neutral" data-pv="q:Q-001" data-pv-title="Q-001" data-pv-body="Which synthetic business-system control owner approves the monthly compliance review?">Q-001</span></span>
    
  </div>
  <div class="conflict-sides">
    
    <div class="conflict-side">
      <div class="conflict-side-label">Position 1</div>
      <div class="conflict-side-body">Synthetic review runs every 30 days</div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="conflict-side">
      <div class="conflict-side-label">Position 2</div>
      <div class="conflict-side-body">Synthetic withholding check runs at each billing cycle</div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
  <div class="conflict-foot">
    <span>Disputed claims: <span class="cite neutral" data-claim="CL-CMP-0001">CL-CMP-0001</span> <span class="cite neutral" data-claim="CL-CMP-0002">CL-CMP-0002</span></span>
    
  </div>
</div>

    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="company-calibration">
      <h2 id="company-calibration">Company calibration</h2>
      
      <p>Confirm the approving role and escalation path <span class="cite neutral" data-pv="q:Q-001" data-pv-title="Q-001" data-pv-body="Which synthetic business-system control owner approves the monthly compliance review?">Q-001</span> <span class="cite neutral" data-pv="xc:XC-01" data-pv-title="XC-01" data-pv-body="Synthetic review interval versus withholding check timing">XC-01</span>.</p>

      
    </section>

